# Listing photo hero (mobile)

Reference: Test Drive `/test-drive` upper photo block.

On phones (`max-width: 640px` or `768px` for auction/shares/debts listing heroes), keep this shape:

- `min-height: 740px` (scene + content shell)
- `border-radius: 0 0 50% 50% / 0 0 4% 4%` — soft elliptical bottom bowl
- `overflow: hidden` so the photo clips to the curve
- `box-shadow: 0 22px 52px rgba(8, 61, 67, 0.18)`

Applies to:

- `.test-drive-hero`
- `.shares-hero-scene` (доли / co-investment)
- `.hero--auction-scene` (аукцион)
- `.debts-hero-scene` (долги)

Do not stretch these mobile heroes to full `100dvh` unless product explicitly asks. Desktop can stay taller / full-bleed without the bowl curve.
